    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1853">

                <pb facs="1478" n="1362" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1362"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 033.1100 K77.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to the President of Venezuela</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The White House</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 1, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am delighted to learn that Secretary Knox was received with such marked
                    cordiality in Venezuela and to assure Your Excellency of my fervent hopes for
                    your continued prosperity and that of Venezuela.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Taft.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
